1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,122
The first law of thermodynamics.

2
00:00:02,122 --> 00:00:08,515
Energy can neither be created nor destroyed, only converted from one form to another.

3
00:00:08,515 --> 00:00:15,481
For any process, the change in internal energy equals the heat absorbed, plus the work done on the system.

